# pointed-l0.env — the #2311 pointed-ladder L0 arm: the final-exam breadth knobs (#2245 arm A parity: severity rubric,
# ground evidence, JOBS=2, the pinned model) over ONE pointed zone, then STAGE 4.5 over the same output with REACH +
# PROMISES. exam.sh stage --pointer narrows the zone's files[] to the anchor contracts, and exam.sh run hands the deep
# call the L0 pointer as --deep-hunt-audit-context (never the breadth call).
# DEEP_HUNT_JOBS=2: parity with the breadth JOBS=2.
# DEEP_HUNT_ZONE_BUDGET_S=25200: a single-anchor zone is 1 target x 3 default lenses = 3 cells = 2 waves at 2 jobs;
#   7 h = 2 waves x 3.5 h, the longest uncapped deep cell measured in this program (#2245 arm A). Every cell that
#   finished in any measured run fits; a longer one is TIMEOUT, which is unmeasured, never CLEAN.
# HARD_STOP_S=28800: it must exceed the zone budget, because a hard stop voids the whole arm, breadth included. The
#   1 h margin only matters for a hung call; the breadth call (STAGE 4 refute included) took 77-235 min per zone
#   under these knobs (#2245 iterations 2-3), so it fits the same per-call stop.
# DEEP_CELL_STALE_S=3600: the #1982 per-cell staleness watchdog kills a deep cell whose dir has had no file written
#   for this long (run-zone-hunt.sh default 900 s; exam.sh clears the variable, so the default would apply). The
#   numa project compiles with viaIR, and `forge test` compiles the whole project through ONE solc before it writes
#   anything into the cell dir: a cold `forge build` of a numa deep-cell repo copy took 1803 s on the bench host (one
#   solc at 99 % of one core, 191 files). 3600 = 2 x 1803 s; the 2x margin covers repair-round recompiles and
#   contests with larger viaIR graphs. At 900 s both deep cells of the first R2 arm died with ENGINE_FAILED
#   stale-watchdog, which VOIDs the whole arm, breadth included (#2245 arm B hit the same on VaultManager C2).
#   Cost: a genuine flat-cyborg hang (#1925) is now killed after <= 60 min instead of 15. The zone budget and
#   HARD_STOP_S above are unchanged and still bound the arm. A deep.* knob: it reaches the STAGE 4.5 call only.
BACKEND=flat-cyborg
MODEL=claude-opus-4-8
JOBS=2
HARD_STOP_S=28800
env.SEVERITY_RUBRIC=1
env.GROUND_EVIDENCE=1
DEEP_PASS=1
deep.DEEP_HUNT_REACH=1
deep.DEEP_HUNT_PROMISES=1
deep.DEEP_HUNT_JOBS=2
deep.DEEP_HUNT_ZONE_BUDGET_S=25200
deep.DEEP_CELL_STALE_S=3600
